  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "疏開（So͘-khai）"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><b>作者：</b></span><span style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><b>邱偉欣</b></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">阮兩个阿媽ê人生lóng有hông liô過一刀。留落來一khî。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">聽講，高雄媽hit時teh bih空襲，ài疏開。In講，代先m̄知影，koh有人走去看炸彈爆炸，講he chiâⁿ súi，像煙花，五彩光，koh有tân雷ná挵鼓。後--來，好玄走去看ê人去hō͘ khian--死，逐家chiah知影ē死人，ài bih。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">疏開去草地，高雄媽手抱二姨kap人kheh火車走去苗栗hia。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">花蓮媽--leh？仝款疏開去草地，仝款手抱細囝，m̄-koh伊無坐火車，伊是盤山過花蓮。Tī山--ni̍h ê時，伊忝kah一定ài坐落來歇喘。幾分鐘了後，伊chiah起身，一尾溜ùi樹仔頂soan落來探，hō͘伊chhoah--一-下！其實lán mā m̄知 he「大蛇哥」</span><i><span style=\"color: #999999; font-size: x-small;\"><b>1</b></span></i><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">是m̄是山神來保護好心ê花蓮媽？</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">兩个阿媽lóng過往--ah……高雄媽ê疏開記持到kah尾，賰一句「早知，就kā lín二姨捏hō͘死」。驚惶kap恨伴伊到人生ê最後，iáu未有記持ê二姨大漢了後哪ē知老母對伊ê疼thàng？</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">花蓮媽是giám硬、巴結ê女性。伊ê代誌我lóng是聽阿姑in講--ê。疏開hō͘人生生疏，骨肉拆開hoⁿh？你拄著「大蛇哥」hit工，手--ni̍h kám是抱「大姑姑」</span><i><span style=\"color: #999999; font-size: x-small;\"><b>2</b></span></i><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">？伊若bē記--得，等lín見著面，ài kā提醒--o͘h。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">※　※　※</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Bē赴疏開就sio-chhōa走--ê是iáu未出世ê孩兒kap老母，tī遠遠遠ê烏克蘭。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">死了後有愛。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">活--落-來--ê kan-ta恨。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"></p><ol><li><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\"><b>客語thai sà kô͘，大尾蛇ê意思。</b></span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\"><b>客語thai kû kû，大漢姑ê意思。</b></span></li></ol><p></p><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEg_vgYrk4hW-sy8lf_5007WQ2siEEHHQ-foS1E7yvfJKkirMC65Z5fzUrVV8MZeP7zzCt4Z9HTCRAvUNg9b8YhdCrfb-DQtLigzgbskNb4RX-s2gWOWqG8Lsg3ZlnKrEgXgXlwx5ec7HJujVca-CSxF1tpZ-JdSCgYyVhWG-vtyNpFz9FIdFS_qIemDTg/s1424/336%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1424\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEg_vgYrk4hW-sy8lf_5007WQ2siEEHHQ-foS1E7yvfJKkirMC65Z5fzUrVV8MZeP7zzCt4Z9HTCRAvUNg9b8YhdCrfb-DQtLigzgbskNb4RX-s2gWOWqG8Lsg3ZlnKrEgXgXlwx5ec7HJujVca-CSxF1tpZ-JdSCgYyVhWG-vtyNpFz9FIdFS_qIemDTg/w450-h640